


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_06_85c96c18:



    voice "2MI_0351"
    miyako "「打扰了」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_06_f7f2b0ab:



    voice "2MI_0352"
    miyako "「哇噗……咳咳」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_06_6b71913d:


    "一打开门，房间里就飘出一股烟雾，把圣夜子给呛到了。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_06_3e1f4e30:



    voice "2SA_0194"
    sachiko "「啊，抱歉」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_06_d78ac969:


    "祥子一边把烟灭掉一边站起身来。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_06_07dbd4ad:



    voice "2MI_0353"
    miyako "「咳咳。我没事」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_06_a2b6b7ff:



    voice "2SA_0195"
    sachiko "「抱歉。我不怎么在房间里抽的」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_06_9e0f0544:


    "下这么大雪不太方便去屋顶上。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_06_b88e4e89:



    voice "2SA_0196"
    sachiko "「于是，咋了？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_06_f5584708:



    voice "2MI_0354"
    miyako "「澡堂空出来了」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_06_55e7c894:



    voice "2SA_0197"
    sachiko "「是么。那个新澡堂咋样？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_06_039a3147:



    voice "2MI_0355"
    miyako "「嗯，非常舒服」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_06_5f424385:



    voice "2SA_0198"
    sachiko "「那就好。啊，去走廊吧。你好不容易洗了澡，在这会沾上烟味的」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_06_6af105a6:



    voice "2MI_0356"
    miyako "「烟抽起来很香吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_06_902f1df1:



    voice "2SA_0199"
    sachiko "「倒也不是」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_06_5f3baded:



    voice "2MI_0357"
    miyako "「那为什么还抽？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_06_321226af:



    voice "2SA_0200"
    sachiko "「我只是在装坏人，还有排解寂寞」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_06_f95bc8fd:



    voice "2MI_0358"
    miyako "「哈啊」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_06_aa28c871:


    "脸上写着不怎么懂的表情。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_06_13cf73ef:



    voice "2MI_0359"
    miyako "「你是从什么时候开始抽烟的？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_06_9a6dc484:



    voice "2SA_0201"
    sachiko "「五年前吧」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_06_4002a9b6:



    voice "2MI_0360"
    miyako "「啊，那你下来之后马上就开始了呢」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_06_f63b89c6:


    "圣夜子有点惊讶。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_06_94989f6f:



    voice "2MI_0361"
    miyako "「是邀请了你的人也吸吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_06_ed66c865:



    voice "2SA_0202"
    sachiko "「…………」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_06_004cfe71:


    "这次祥子露出了意外的表情。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_06_ce294a79:



    voice "2SA_0203"
    sachiko "「算是吧」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_06_2850214a:


    "回答虽然暧昧，但并没有否定。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_06_e9b5474f:



    voice "2SA_0204"
    sachiko "「你为什么会这么想？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_06_e27bca24:



    voice "2MI_0362"
    miyako "「邀请了自己的人带来的影响很大。因为我也是这样」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_06_f9210a9d:


    "无邪的笑容。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_06_1dca68ef:



    voice "2SA_0205"
    sachiko "「我带来的影响可没啥好的哦？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_06_55ac23b0:



    voice "2MI_0363"
    miyako "「是吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_06_a62ba540:



    voice "2SA_0206"
    sachiko "「虽然我觉得你有时间了也可以去试试酒和烟，但是我们两个的人设也得保持好」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_06_04a519ec:



    voice "2MI_0364"
    miyako "「好」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_06_58a08bed:



    voice "2SA_0207"
    sachiko "「暴露了的话，我可是会被阳菜亲给踹飞的」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_06_e23e9a2d:



    voice "2MI_0365"
    miyako "「啊哈哈。真是个无可救药的大人呢」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_06_a4d8e831:



    voice "2MI_0366"
    miyako "「让你吸烟的人也是个无可救药的大人吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_06_0ccb98f7:



    voice "2SA_0208"
    sachiko "「那是当然，残酷冷血」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_06_c88647c6:



    voice "2MI_0367"
    miyako "「那，不是不能向这种人学习吗」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_06_61cf5640:



    voice "2SA_0209"
    sachiko "「啊哈哈哈，已经晚了」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_06_d1b125fa:


    "不能怪别人。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_06_6de48df4:



    voice "2SA_0210"
    sachiko "「好，趁着水还没冷掉回去吧」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_06_05c4d100:



    voice "2MI_0368"
    miyako "「好的，晚安」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_06_ed5b3d86:



    voice "2SA_0211"
    sachiko "「……已经空了吗」"
